		(property "Description" "Arduino Nano A2 I/O for the front panel. 1-6 LED1-LED6 (D2-D7): each drives one green/red LED pair, pin LOW = green, HIGH = red, toggling = blinking; the LEDs and their resistors are on the panel. 7 SCL (A5), 8 SDA (A4): I2C text display. 9-12 KEY1-KEY4 (A3, A2, A1, A0): panel buttons to GND, read as digital inputs with the Nano's internal pull-ups. 13 +5V, 14 GND."
